00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:30,890
you probably know our product as the brushing blend.

00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:32,970
However, we feel the name brushing blend

00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:35,490
limits some of the important ways our blend can be used

00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:37,330
to help create a healthier mouth.

00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:39,370
So we've changed the name to the oral wellness

00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:41,290
healthy mouth blend.

00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:42,930
We feel the name the healthy mouth blend

00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:45,730
best describes why we make the product

00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:48,250
to help people in creating healthier mouths.

00:00:49,930 --> 00:00:52,970
We get a giggle from folks calling to order saying,

00:00:52,970 --> 00:00:56,370
I want to order more of that tooth oil stuff.

00:00:56,370 --> 00:00:58,450
So whatever you want to call our blend,

00:00:58,450 --> 00:01:00,210
know that it's the same awesome formula

00:01:00,210 --> 00:01:01,810
you've grown to appreciate the benefits

00:01:01,810 --> 00:01:03,130
of using in your own mouth.

00:01:04,250 --> 00:01:06,170
Next, if you're new to using our products,

00:01:06,210 --> 00:01:09,330
let's quickly cover how to get the drops out of the bottle.

00:01:09,330 --> 00:01:11,890
The way to get the healthy mouth blend onto your toothbrush

00:01:11,890 --> 00:01:14,850
is to fully invert the bottle and count to three.

00:01:14,850 --> 00:01:18,210
One, two, and the drops will begin to flow.

00:01:18,210 --> 00:01:22,090
If counting to three feels like too long to wait,

00:01:22,090 --> 00:01:24,290
seriously, you may want to check in on your stress levels

00:01:24,290 --> 00:01:26,850
and take a deep breath while you're at it.

00:01:26,850 --> 00:01:30,010
Okay, onto the many ways to use the healthy mouth blend.

00:01:31,450 --> 00:01:33,410
Of course, you can use it on a toothbrush

00:01:33,410 --> 00:01:35,050
either as a standalone product

00:01:35,050 --> 00:01:37,410
or with your favorite paste or tooth powder.

00:01:37,410 --> 00:01:39,930
Generally, two to three drops on a moistened toothbrush

00:01:39,930 --> 00:01:41,250
will serve as an excellent way

00:01:41,250 --> 00:01:43,050
to deliver the potent anti-microbials

00:01:43,050 --> 00:01:46,370
in the healthy mouth blend along and under the gum line.

00:01:48,050 --> 00:01:51,450
While you can use the healthy mouth blend with any toothbrush,

00:01:51,450 --> 00:01:53,610
