00:02:01,090 --> 00:02:03,690
Another way to use the healthy mouth blend is to put a drop

00:02:03,810 --> 00:02:08,130
into a bit of water and use that as a mouthwash.

00:02:08,130 --> 00:02:09,970
The benefits of using the healthy mouth blend

00:02:09,970 --> 00:02:13,170
as a mouthwash is to support all the areas in the mouth

00:02:13,170 --> 00:02:14,650
