00:02:14,650 --> 00:02:18,530
to the organic plant botanicals while brushing.

00:02:18,530 --> 00:02:21,490
And it's also a very fast way as a mouth freshener,

00:02:21,490 --> 00:02:24,850
as a mouth wake up call and just bring greater freshness

00:02:24,850 --> 00:02:27,450
