00:02:29,290 --> 00:02:31,770
The next and perhaps most powerful way to use

00:02:31,810 --> 00:02:35,330
the healthy mouth blend is to put a drop on your floss.

00:02:35,330 --> 00:02:37,450
If you have active gum disease,

00:02:37,450 --> 00:02:40,410
this technique is the most powerful way to deliver

00:02:40,410 --> 00:02:43,090
the full strength anti-microbial oils

00:02:43,090 --> 00:02:45,490
into the gum pockets around your molars.

00:02:45,490 --> 00:02:46,890
So here's how you do it.

00:02:46,890 --> 00:02:51,490
Simply put a drop on your finger, set the bottle down,

00:02:51,490 --> 00:02:55,170
quickly, it's easier when you're in a bathroom

00:02:55,170 --> 00:02:57,890
and then place your floss on the drip

00:02:57,890 --> 00:03:01,490
and run your fingers along the floss.

00:03:01,490 --> 00:03:03,970
This way you're impregnating the floss

00:03:03,970 --> 00:03:07,530
with the potent plant organic botanicals in the blend

00:03:07,530 --> 00:03:09,210
and now you floss as normal.

00:03:10,490 --> 00:03:12,690
You see gum disease most commonly gets going

00:03:12,690 --> 00:03:14,130
between the molars first,

00:03:14,130 --> 00:03:16,130
which happens to be the most difficult place

00:03:16,130 --> 00:03:19,770
to disrupt and disorganize the bad bugs with brushing.

00:03:19,770 --> 00:03:21,890
So by first putting a drop on the floss

00:03:21,890 --> 00:03:24,410
and spreading along the floss and flossing with it,

00:03:24,410 --> 00:03:26,330
you're getting the oils of the healthy mouth blend

00:03:26,330 --> 00:03:29,210
deeper into the gum pockets and between the molars

00:03:29,210 --> 00:03:31,970
at the same time and full strength.

00:03:31,970 --> 00:03:34,570
Very potent combination.

00:03:34,570 --> 00:03:36,770
If you want to make drastic positive changes

00:03:36,770 --> 00:03:38,930
